      "rkaf:appliesInJurisdiction": [],
      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "In containers at or near any point of generation where wastes initially accumulate which is under the control of the operator of the process generating the waste, provided that all of the conditions for exemption in this rule are met."
    },
