      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "When a generator accumulates acute hazardous waste or non-acute hazardous waste in excess of the amounts listed in paragraph (A) of rule 3745-52-15 at or near any point of generation, during the three-consecutive-calendar-day period."
    },
